,"source":"vndb","value":"F"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"158"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Long distance relative of Yuuto from head family in Britain. Completely opposite of Yuuto the third-rate wizard, she is extremely talented and skilled wizard with high pride. Despite being completely perfect when it comes to magic, she lacks of common sense about the world around her and uses misleading words a lot which is always the main source of trouble for Yuuto. Even though Yuuto warned her a lot about taking care not to reveal magic to people, she still uses it unconsciously from time to time. She comes to Japan to be Yuuto's master."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c89967"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/63/638fd360e7d64de8c6f3ecbf12cb05dc41385a25b61702278783a529c53148d9.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/dc/dcdca62e0f84cf9d1dd501b6ad14f04eba1ba92070d9885df9011da2b1cd5e0a.webp","width":131,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"秋野 花","creatorId":"vndb:s902","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s902","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s902","name":"あさみ ほとり","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:84484","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c89968","characterName":"桜宮 氷緒","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c89968"},"originalCharacterName":"桜宮 氷緒","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"cupSize":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"E"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"160"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Yuuto's childhood friend and younger one of two daughters of Sakuranomiya inn which is considered the most popular place in town. Since Yuuto's family used to do same business as hers, she has always seen Yuuto's family as rival until now. She secretly has feeling for Yuuto and always practices her favorite wrestling moves on him whenever he sexual harasses her. Because of her too much serious attitude about working, she is extremely shy toward customers at her inn which makes her fail a lot. She is very kind and overprotective toward Toune like Yuuto."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c89968"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/04/04a742062ad032df33d1fc9ff8a6e8984f8dde74fe521e91e9c665261684735e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7c/7c68121653103b2806a9ecc4f20b694a9d3c43df894624ba34fb4ebb71e8b470.webp","width":131,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小鳥居 夕花","creatorId":"vndb:s979","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s979","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s979","name":"高森 奈津美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:84485","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c89969","characterName":"卯月 透音","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c89969"},"originalCharacterName":"卯月 透音","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"cupSize":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"B"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"145"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Since her ancestors have been serving Yuuto's family for a long time by tradition, she has always been with Yuuto since childhood. She always wears maid uniform at home 